        © {currentYear} Saimese Cybersecurity Network. Built with <span class="text-cyber-accent">❤</span> for the cybersecurity community.
      </p>
      <p class="text-gray-500 text-xs mt-2">
        Educational purposes only. Hack ethically.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
